12,13],"groups":[]}},"sources":[{"part":1,"type":"user-provided-html","label":"The_University_of_Life.html","reference":"The_University_of_Life.html"}]},"explanations":{"1":{"part":1,"en":"FALSE — Paragraph 1 says gappers travel “often supplementing their limited funds by taking on casual work”. ‘Often’ and ‘supplementing’ is very different from ‘the majority must work’.","uz":"FALSE — 1-paragrafda “gapper”lar ko‘pincha cheklangan mablag‘ini vaqtinchalik ish bilan to‘ldirishi aytiladi. Bu “ko‘pchiligi ishlashga majbur” degani emas.","quotes":["often supplementing their limited funds by taking on casual work"],"ru":"FALSE — В пункте 1 говорится, что гэпперы путешествуют, «часто пополняя свои ограниченные средства, берясь за случайную работу». «Часто» и «дополнение» сильно отличаются от «большинство должно работать».","translationProvenance":{"ru":{"type":"machine-translation","sourceLanguage":"en","provider":"Google Translate","sourceSha256":"998790598161a7a53618d7c19c1aa1a82b2058108b9fdbcdb7d872365c8c8e25"}}},"2":{"part":1,"en":"TRUE — Paragraph 2: gap years are “offering a chance to think about why you should study, or if you need to study at all”.","uz":"TRUE — 2-paragraf: tanaffus yili nima uchun o‘qish kerakligi yoki umuman o‘qish zarurmi degan savol ustida o‘ylash imkonini beradi.","quotes":["offering a chance to think about why you should study, or if you need to study at all"],"ru":"TRUE — Параграф 2: годы перерыва «дают возможность подумать о том, почему вам следует учиться и нужно ли вам вообще учиться».","translationProvenance":{"ru":{"type":"machine-translation","sourceLanguage":"en","provider":"Google Translate","sourceSha256":"d64bbeceb992e2abdbce38b364af4c66ed1bf7a9cbe7f9c9ea8f72938cdd3c63"}}},"3":{"part":1,"en":"TRUE — Paragraph 2 cites UCAS data showing “a steady annual increase in this age group over the previous three years”.","uz":"TRUE — 2-paragrafda UCAS ma’lumotlariga ko‘ra, so‘nggi uch yilda bu yosh guruhida barqaror yillik o‘sish kuzatilgani aytilgan.","quotes":["figures that show a steady annual increase in this age group over the previous three years"],"ru":"TRUE — В пункте 2 приводятся данные UCAS, показывающие «стабильный ежегодный прирост в этой возрастной группе за последние три года».","translationProvenance":{"ru":{"type":"machine-translation","sourceLanguage":"en","provider":"Google Translate","sourceSha256":"b19976cef62b5ca5b838fdffc1af8441cf0a25656c178f60329d820916077742"}}},"4":{"part":1,"en":"FALSE — Paragraph 3 says she worried she would struggle “despite having all the attributes of a good student”. So she does have the right qualities.","uz":"FALSE — 3-paragrafda u yaxshi talabaga xos barcha fazilatlarga ega bo‘lsa-da, qiyinchilikdan xavotirlangani aytiladi. Demak, kerakli fazilatlar unda bor.","quotes":["despite having all the attributes of a good student"],"ru":"FALSE — В пункте 3 говорится, что она беспокоилась, что ей придется бороться, «несмотря на то, что у нее есть все качества хорошей ученицы». Значит, у нее есть нужные качества.","translationProvenance":{"ru":{"type":"machine-translation","sourceLanguage":"en","provider":"Google Translate","sourceSha256":"2712a59be947fde1527c7f84a1340367bd093b2ae1244edda636e598da87e3ca"}}},"5":{"part":1,"en":"TRUE — Paragraph 3: “it dawned on her that if you don’t have qualifications, or the right qualifications, you have fewer work choices.”","uz":"TRUE — 3-paragraf: u malaka yoki to‘g‘ri malaka bo‘lmasa, ish tanlash imkoniyati kamayishini tushunib yetgan.","quotes":["you have fewer work choices"],"ru":"TRUE — Параграф 3: «Ей пришло в голову, что если у вас нет квалификации или нужной квалификации, у вас меньше вариантов работы».","translationProvenance":{"ru":{"type":"machine-translation","sourceLanguage":"en","provider":"Google Translate","sourceSha256":"864f9f837c2ba9b141df225bb082719eb06a19114c132bf5a49abd7312820f2b"}}},"6":{"part":1,"en":"voluntary work — Paragraph 4: “Christine decided to head to Mexico to do voluntary work at a children’s home. She was there for a year.”","uz":"voluntary work — 4-paragraf: Christine Meksikaga bolalar uyida ko‘ngilli ishlash (voluntary work) uchun borgan va u yerda bir yil turgan.","quotes":["decided to head to Mexico to do voluntary work"],"ru":"волонтерская работа — Параграф 4: «Кристина решила поехать в Мексику, чтобы заняться волонтерской работой в детском доме. Она пробыла там год».","translationProvenance":{"ru":{"type":"machine-translation","sourceLanguage":"en","provider":"Google Translate","sourceSha256":"8df9efe623388fcf1a5531b0cc7aac8f4a1fb99bf64543a53ae45020955815a5"}}},"7":{"part":1,"en":"confidence — Paragraph 4: “She never expected that working in Mexico would give her such a sense of confidence.”","uz":"confidence — 4-paragraf: Meksikadagi ish unga shunchalik ishonch (confidence) tuyg‘usini berishini u kutmagan edi.","quotes":["would give her such a sense of confidence"],"ru":"уверенность — Параграф 4: «Она никогда не ожидала, что работа в Мексике даст ей такое чувство уверенности».","translationProvenance":{"ru":{"type":"machine-translation","sourceLanguage":"en","provider":"Google Translate","sourceSha256":"e1eb7ef4edbd0625ece33dc84b77fe4bdfca2bbc8030533da94e0a8fdd5580f3"}}},"8":{"part":1,"en":"education — Paragraph 4: “she decided to make a fresh start in education by enrolling on a course in Social Sciences and Humanities.”","uz":"education — 4-paragraf: Buyuk Britaniyaga qaytgach, u ta’limni (education) yangidan boshlashga qaror qilib, kursga yozilgan.","quotes":["she decided to make a fresh start in education"],"ru":"образование — Параграф 4: «она решила начать образование заново, записавшись на курс социальных и гуманитарных наук».","translationProvenance":{"ru":{"type":"machine-translation","sourceLanguage":"en","provider":"Google Translate","sourceSha256":"5e2a6930240a83dcaefdab8110758769db2d369be14fdb8775bc9a80b082efb3"}}},"9":{"part":1,"en":"international development — Paragraph 5: “Christine is now working towards a degree in International Development at Bath University.”","uz":"international development — 5-paragraf: Christine hozir Bath universitetida “International Development” yo‘nalishida o‘qimoqda.","quotes":["working towards a degree in International Development at Bath University"],"ru":"международное развитие — Параграф 5: «Кристин сейчас работает над получением степени по международному развитию в Университете Бата».","translationProvenance":{"ru":{"type":"machine-translation","sourceLanguage":"en","provider":"Google Translate","sourceSha256":"84291466031fc65bf6ad7892c177bdc1c7b349a10fc976008e6855f66033c4c1"}}},"10":{"part":1,"en":"working abroad — Paragraph 5: “she now speaks good Spanish – a skill she says she intends to keep up, perhaps by working abroad.”","uz":"working abroad — 5-paragraf: u yaxshi ispancha gapiradi va bu ko‘nikmani, ehtimol, chet elda ishlash (working abroad) orqali saqlab qolmoqchi.","quotes":["she intends to keep up, perhaps by working abroad"],"ru":"работа за границей — Параграф 5: «Теперь она хорошо говорит по-испански — этот навык, по ее словам, она намерена поддерживать, возможно, работая за границей».","translationProvenance":{"ru":{"type":"machine-translation","sourceLanguage":"en","provider":"Google Translate","sourceSha256":"086c9f9ce5ff996e5f00f2ed88727bea7e03f708f8e95bdda23aa992aa34ea67"}}},"11":{"part":1,"en":"a focus — Paragraph 7: “the ICYE only really works if participants have a focus for what they want to do, see and study.”","uz":"a focus — 7-paragraf: ICYE faqat ishtirokchilarda nima qilish, ko‘rish va o‘rganishni istashiga aniq maqsad (a focus) bo‘lgandagina samarali bo‘ladi.","quotes":["participants have a focus for what they want to do, see and study"],"ru":"Фокус — Параграф 7: «ICYE действительно работает только в том случае, если участники фокусируются на том, что они хотят делать, видеть и изучать».","translationProvenance":{"ru":{"type":"machine-translation","sourceLanguage":"en","provider":"Google Translate","sourceSha256":"60a96c60f9ca60287c439482919febb8a1e520d163888d8135a014bc65bf073c"}}},"12":{"part":1,"en":"young girls — Paragraph 7: “she now wants to set up her own vocational training programme for young girls in northern Uganda.”","uz":"young girls — 7-paragraf: u shimoliy Ugandadagi yosh qizlar (young girls) uchun kasb-hunar o‘quv dasturini tashkil qilmoqchi.","quotes":["vocational training programme for young girls in northern Uganda"],"ru":"молодые девушки — Параграф 7: «Теперь она хочет создать собственную программу профессиональной подготовки для молодых девушек на севере Уганды».","translationProvenance":{"ru":{"type":"machine-translation","sourceLanguage":"en","provider":"Google Translate","sourceSha256":"de8e4707da9768e32677edfd954c68d20fa71be7907bac6eab4e0ffa63cf866e"}}},"13":{"part":1,"en":"goals — Paragraph 7 ends: “Agnes says her time in the UK has helped her to set her goals for the future.”","uz":"goals — 7-paragraf oxiri: Agnesning aytishicha, Britaniyada o‘tkazgan vaqti unga kelajak uchun maqsadlarini (goals) belgilashga yordam bergan.","quotes":["has helped her to set her goals for the future"],"ru":"цели — Параграф 7 заканчивается словами: «Агнес говорит, что время, проведенное в Великобритании, помогло ей поставить цели на будущее».","translationProvenance":{"ru":{"type":"machine-translation","sourceLanguage":"en","provider":"Google Translate","sourceSha256":"e16030109a110f72f774c1cd40fff8780816693990cc94296b4e94b5d61e02b1"}}}}}]]
